    # mct "Mmmm. This is so nice. And Lyssa mentioned she'd get to sleep in today."
    mct "음으음. 이게 정말 좋은데. 리사가 오늘은 자기도 늦잠 잘 거라고 했었지."

# game/code/e03/e03s02.rpy:26
